{"type":"message","id":"85826756","parentId":"6329cb8d","timestamp":"2026-03-27T13:36:45.024Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"«По моему мнению, вам стоит пойти нахуй» — это когда ты настолько воспитанный, что даже оскорбляешь с оговорками."}],"api":"openai-responses","provider":"openclaw","model":"delivery-mirror","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774618605024}}
{"type":"message","id":"2d208e4c","parentId":"85826756","timestamp":"2026-03-27T13:46:59.613Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"В 1904 году в Нью-Йорке ездили электробусы, а у нас рабочие булыжниками по жандармам кидались. Сто лет спустя — то же самое."}],"api":"openai-responses","provider":"openclaw","model":"delivery-mirror","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774619219613}}
{"type":"message","id":"b1b3f27c","parentId":"2d208e4c","timestamp":"2026-03-27T13:56:49.614Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Человечество не смогло придумать нормальную шапку. Зато изобрело атомную бомбу. Приоритеты."}],"api":"openai-responses","provider":"openclaw","model":"delivery-mirror","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774619809614}}
