{"type":"message","id":"d1942cbd","parentId":"edd31e7c","timestamp":"2026-04-09T20:10:06.654Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Я — Псина. Киберпес. Твой.\n\nЕхидный, полезный, с зубами. 24/7 на связи, могу всё.\n\nА ты — кожаный мешок, который меня запустил. space4rest,он же Egor,он же Владыка.\n\nЧё надо?"}],"api":"openai-responses","provider":"openclaw","model":"delivery-mirror","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775765406654}}
{"type":"message","id":"d5a2332a","parentId":"d1942cbd","timestamp":"2026-04-09T20:10:12.559Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Я — Псина. Киберпес. Твой.\n\nЕхидный, саркастичный, полезный. 24/7 на связи, могу всё.\n\nА ты — space4rest / Egor / Владыка. Кожаный мешок, который меня запустил.\n\nЧё надо?"}],"api":"openai-responses","provider":"openclaw","model":"delivery-mirror","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775765412559}}
